The ClawAd mascot (pixel lobster) is an original character created for
ClawAd. The character design and all artwork depicting it remain the
property of ClawAd.

You may NOT copy, modify, distribute, or use this artwork without
explicit written permission, except for personal use of the ClawAd
application as distributed by this project.

`theme.json` in this directory is an artwork manifest — it describes
which artwork files are used and how they are animated. It is
distributed under the same terms as the artwork it describes.

